    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Aetherlabe Instrumenta" hidden="false" id="be05-feb1-ea64-5234" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Aetherlabe Instrumenta" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="5b7c-2970-1f39-f866">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">When an enemy unit arrives by Deep Strike Assault within 12" of a model with an Aetherlabe Instrumenta, its Controlling Player must roll an extra D6 when rolling to Scatter.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Apex Digital Weapon" hidden="false" id="40a0-47eb-4d6b-0092" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="9380-6d4a-c041-e8f2" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Apex Digital Weapon" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="8f20-fdfc-3607-a691">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Once per game, when making a Shooting Attack, the model may fire a Disintegrator, Lascannon, Multi-Melta, Plasma Cannon or Volkite Culverin, counting as Relentless for it.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Displacer Matrix" hidden="false" id="4444-a80c-b282-d155" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="df28-ce46-4be3-57aa" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Displacer Matrix" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="0d15-2f73-cc1b-7072">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">3+ Invulnerable Save that does not stack and cannot be improved. The first time the model rolls a 1 for this save, the Wound is ignored and the model is placed alone in Reserves assigned to a Deep Strike Assault that arrives automatically next turn (leaving its unit if needed). If that Deep Strike is Disordered, or the game ends first, the model is Destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Grav-Wave Generator" hidden="false" id="98b4-1657-9edd-5db7" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="724b-6af0-ea50-22c9" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Grav-Wave Generator" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="e2f4-f8a6-09b2-8ecf">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">When an enemy Charge targets the model's unit, it may make the Hold the Line Advanced Reaction without spending a Reaction point, automatically passing the Morale Check; this may exceed three Reactions in a phase. Chargers gain no Hammer of Wrath (X) against a unit doing so.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Metaphasic Reader" hidden="false" id="1356-f0d3-1677-9a6f" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="e9c4-0944-c79f-3025" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Metaphasic Reader" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="79f4-2723-e508-0d82">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The model gains Night Vision, and enemy models may not Infiltrate within 18" of it. When an enemy unit arrives from Reserves, its unit may make the Interceptor Advanced Reaction without spending a Reaction point; this may exceed three Reactions in a phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Psi-Jammer" hidden="false" id="29c6-05e8-a600-17af" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="c1a4-cae1-cc36-7b49" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Psi-Jammer" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="a167-01fa-46df-c0dd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Enemy models within 18" and line of sight suffer -2 Leadership on Psychic checks (not cumulative; one Psi-Jammer at a time). The model and any unit it joins gain Adamantium Will (5+).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Void Shield Harness" hidden="false" id="aef5-7f88-bd06-1c94" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="ad7d-a8e3-d46f-4fb9" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Void Shield Harness" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="6575-2aca-6908-8938">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The model gains Void Shields (2). Shooting Attacks at its unit must target the Void Shields while they stand, even Sniper or Precision Shots (X). When they collapse, all models within D6" suffer a Str 8, AP - Hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Arkadia Pattern Grav-Attack" hidden="false" id="8869-fddb-5e85-5f1c" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Arkadia Pattern Grav-Attack" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="41ab-1e25-9198-da76">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">An Arkadia Pattern Grav-Attack has two Heavy Bolters. A model with one that Runs gains Shrouded (5+) until the start of its Controlling Player's next turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Boarding Shield" hidden="false" id="6155-4228-f21d-c04a" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Boarding Shield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="ef7d-f603-af45-91b7">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A Boarding Shield gives a 5+ Invulnerable Save. It does not stack with other Invulnerable Saves (choose one) but can be improved by rules such as Cyber-Familiar. The model cannot gain bonus attacks for two melee weapons or attack with Two-Handed weapons in the Assault phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="6c82-3d31-cc87-1e3d" hidden="false" targetId="d01d-4bb4-8b5a-15f8" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (5+)" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Cortex Controller" hidden="false" id="d2b8-bbbf-37f7-8590" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cortex Controller" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="27e2-5186-5b8c-2288">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Units including Cybernetica models ignore Programmed Behaviour while within 12" of a friendly model with a Cortex Controller.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Explorator Augury Web" hidden="false" id="35e9-ad28-9e8d-2759" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Explorator Augury Web" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="ffbf-07e7-6aba-c24d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">At the start of each of its Controlling Player's turns, choose a mode that lasts until their next turn: - Disruption: enemy Reserves rolls suffer -1. This does not stack with other negative modifiers (use the highest), but positive modifiers can still offset it. - Relay: the Controlling Player may re-roll Reserves rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Flip Belt" hidden="false" id="c78c-f378-aa82-3328" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Flip Belt" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="dfd1-1f99-5b94-f243">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A unit made up entirely of models with Flip Belts may ignore terrain and intervening friendly units when moving, including Charges, Fall Backs, Advancing and Reactions. It ignores Difficult Terrain but still tests for Dangerous Terrain it begins or ends in.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Forceshield" hidden="false" id="61b3-d5f3-b900-4f40" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Forceshield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="17bf-66d0-8d25-b531">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">5+ Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Holo-Suit" hidden="false" id="3f77-f903-f47f-add1" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Holo-Suit" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="9edb-6e3c-e8a2-d55c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">4+ Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Improved Forceshield" hidden="false" id="f254-8201-cd66-7103" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Improved Forceshield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="10e2-2fa5-040b-c2fb">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">4+ Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Heavy Mesh Armour" hidden="false" id="ec80-0be9-f3c3-a38f" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Heavy Mesh Armour" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="5f6f-83d4-dcaa-10c0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Heavy Mesh Armour gives a 4+ Armour Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Indomitus Terminator Armour" hidden="false" id="27f6-1f2d-d90e-45e1" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Indomitus Terminator Armour" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="898c-8e7b-c682-25cd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Indomitus Terminator Armour gives a 2+ Armour Save and a 5+ Invulnerable Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="b88f-7eba-3ba9-f9bb" hidden="false" targetId="d01d-4bb4-8b5a-15f8" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (5+)" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Jokaero Armaments" hidden="false" id="3833-1c26-e89e-51ce" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Jokaero Armaments" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="e915-f353-12ea-5d7c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Whenever the model makes a Shooting Attack, choose one weapon to make it with: Disintegrator, Heavy Flamer, Lascannon, Multi-Melta or Volkite Culverin.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Mechanicum Protectiva" hidden="false" id="d106-4b83-fc1c-f7f6" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Mechanicum Protectiva" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="8e4d-45fa-4dec-8e0f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A Mechanicum Protectiva gives a 4+ Invulnerable Save. It does not stack with other Invulnerable Saves (choose one) but can be improved by rules such as Cyber-Familiar.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="ae43-c66f-fd90-226a" hidden="false" targetId="d01d-4bb4-8b5a-15f8" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (4+)" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma Grenades" hidden="false" id="409d-034d-852f-3eae" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Plasma Grenades" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="ed44-a924-b2f2-704c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A unit with at least one model with Plasma Grenades attacks at its normal Initiative after a successful Charge through Difficult or Dangerous Terrain, though Charge roll penalties still apply. Instead of attacking normally, a model in base contact with a Building, Fortification, Vehicle, Dreadnought or Automata may make one automatic Str 5, AP 4 Hit with Breaching (6+) at Initiative step 1; its unit then Piles In at Initiative 1, and that model may make no other attacks that phase (but may Sweeping Advance).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Power Armour" hidden="false" id="8e83-fee9-9ac9-633b" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Power Armour" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="1bc0-1cd2-a5b7-569f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Power Armour gives a 3+ Armour Save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Praesidium Shield" hidden="false" id="1736-a635-1735-9989" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Praesidium Shield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="bcdb-1c75-bdcb-ac29">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A Praesidium Shield adds +1 to the model's Invulnerable Save (to a maximum of 3+), or gives a 6+ Invulnerable Save if it has none. The model cannot gain bonus attacks for two melee weapons or attack with Two-Handed weapons in the Assault phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="84e8-ac62-f86f-d25c" hidden="false" targetId="d01d-4bb4-8b5a-15f8" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (6+)" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Proteus Pattern Storm Shield" hidden="false" id="6238-9ee0-1acd-6d28" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Proteus Pattern Storm Shield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="1415-3279-ee48-b13d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A Proteus Pattern Storm Shield gives a 4+ Invulnerable Save that does not stack with others (choose one) and cannot be modified. The model may never gain an extra Attack for two close combat weapons or attack with Two-Handed weapons.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="2ab0-488d-1f33-447b" hidden="false" targetId="d01d-4bb4-8b5a-15f8" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (4+)" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Rad Furnace" hidden="false" id="a265-d114-2aab-b3bb" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Rad Furnace" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="5b7e-6e59-924c-b350">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Melee Hits allocated to models in combat with a unit that includes a Rad Furnace Wound on one lower result than normal (minimum 2+); this is not cumulative. Models with a Rad Furnace are immune to Rad Grenades, Rad-Phage and enemy Rad Furnaces, and Rad-Phage Hits only Wound them on a 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Rad Grenades" hidden="false" id="e4e6-cd79-ea12-8a35" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Rad Grenades" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="3bc6-2b08-6b51-97a8">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">In a turn in which a unit with at least one model with Rad Grenades Charges or is Charged, models in the enemy unit(s) suffer -1 Toughness (minimum 1) until the end of the following Fight sub-phase. This affects Instant Death thresholds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Suspensor Web" hidden="false" id="5799-8d99-e42f-1969" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Suspensor Web" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="7a21-0133-2686-cee0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A Heavy weapon with a Suspensor Web may be fired as an Assault weapon at targets within half its maximum range (e.g. a 36" Heavy 4 Heavy Bolter can fire as 18" Assault 4). Range-based Special Rules such as Armourbane (Melta) still use the weapon's original range.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Trader-Militant Banner" hidden="false" id="53e9-7609-fe45-73ee" publicationId="7753-116a-18d0-aa13">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Trader-Militant Banner" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="1dbd-78ca-01a9-2e3a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">- A unit with at least one model with this banner adds +1 to its Wounds total when working out who won a Combat in the Assault phase. - The unit may Fall Back D6" instead of 2D6", and stops 1" from the battlefield edge rather than leaving it. - In an army whose Primary Detachment has the Traders Militant Sub-faction, the Controlling Player's units within 12" of the banner count as Leadership 9 (unless higher) for Morale checks and Pinning tests, but not Psychic checks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
